      "side": 1,
      "message": "Reusing search-bar directly seems error-prone. It has logic which are specific to searching. Like sending \"handle-search\" event on Enter. Even if nothing is broken at the moment, it can too easily be broken in the future, if more search-related things get added to gr-search-bar. Maybe it\u0027s better to use gr-autocomplete directly (or some other way to split generic functionality away from specific one for re-use)",
