      "writtenOn": "2025-08-26T09:59:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003cgr-search-bar\u003e has currently only one usage.\n\nSo I prefer that we update the component and fix bugs along the way, moving more functionality into the parent rather than using autocomplete directly.\n\n\u003e Maybe it\u0027s better to use gr-autocomplete directly\n\nYes, but that adds a lot of work as of now without clear indications that we are indeed running into major bugs.\n\nLet\u0027s consider this as a future item.",
