      "writtenOn": "2025-08-26T11:18:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I disagree, you would have to keep adding more things to gr-search-bar which don\u0027t make sense for it. For example, the magnifying glass icon makes no sense here, so you you will need to add the ability to hide the magnifying glass icon, but why a parameter like this should be part of gr-search-bar is unclear. This will make the code very messy and we already have problems with tech debt in the codebase. I worry that we increasing amount of the mess, making it harder to untangle in the future.",
