      "writtenOn": "2025-08-26T11:42:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e This will make the code very messy and we already have problems with tech debt in the codebase\n\nThat is part of prototyping and trying to implement a MVP.\n\nWith this logic, we are permanently stopping us from trying to build a prototype UI.\n\nOverall I am fine with this solution. GrSearchBar has all the operators hardcoded and gets us close to 90%+ UX we envisioned almost out of the box.\n\nIf you feel too strongly about extracting the UI component, I am happy to let you create it and wait for it to be done.\n\nOr you can file a bug for it and we can get it prioritised. IMO at the current stage of the project, it doesn\u0027t make sense to do it as of now. Post MVP launch, it makes sense to do it especially once we get a better sense of bugs based on internal team usage.",
